tpm 1
boot power
card 1 re/movies/cards/saved-bad-a.mcd
card 2 none
# SW_ON from power-on with no input, slot 1 holding a save file (card-save's card, copy A
# corrupted: one byte flipped, so its checksum fails and copy B is used); slot 2 empty. The card check
# loads the save into the state block; then the copyright screen and TIT_DEMO.
end 372
